# A Poetry project with no lock file, in the documented layout where `[project]`
# carries the version constraint and `[tool.poetry]` overrides it with a local
# path for development.
#
# Poetry's own extractor marks that dependency `path-dependency` -- "do not
# update this" -- and this manager inherits that judgement by delegating to it.
# That is not the same statement as "I cannot update this file", which is why
# `cannotUpdate` is set explicitly rather than inferred from every dependency
# being skipped. Inferring it would let `pep621` survive and propose bumping the
# constraint Poetry deliberately ignores.
poetry_requirements(name="poetry")
